{
 "about": {
  "ja": "版ごとの op 数・PoC 数・回帰テスト数の実測。過去の版の行は記録であり書き換えない(tests/test_trust_block.py が指紋で固定)。新しい版を出すときは行を 1 つ足す。",
  "en": "Measured operator, PoC and regression-test counts per released version. Rows for past versions are records and are never edited (tests/test_trust_block.py pins them by fingerprint). Each release appends one row."
 },
 "method": {
  "measured_on": "2026-10-11",
  "ja": "各タグを別の作業ツリーに checkout し、optional backend を全部入れた環境(Windows、Python 3.11)で数えた。registry / n 入力 / 色 / 台帳はその版のコードを import して数え、索引の計はその版の索引生成を走らせた値、PoC は examples2d の poc_* の本数、テストは pytest --collect-only の件数。0.6.0 の行は v0.6.0 と同じ中身のツリーで測った。",
  "en": "Each tag was checked out into its own working tree and counted with every optional backend installed (Windows, Python 3.11). Registry / n-ary / colour / ledger counts come from importing that version's code; the index total from running that version's index builder; PoC = number of poc_* entries in examples2d; tests = pytest --collect-only count. The 0.6.0 row was measured on a tree with the same content as v0.6.0."
 },
